{"note":"<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n  <head>\r\n    <title>My Personal Introduction<\/title>\r\n      <style>\r\n        body {\r\n          background-color: 1dd2ae;\r\n}\r\nh1 {\r\ncolor: fc0d5b;\r\n}\r\np {\r\ncolor: c74e6e;\r\n}\r\n      <\/style>\r\n  <\/head>\r\n<body>\r\n  <h1>My name is Alonzo Johnson<\/h1>\r\n    <p>I am a student in web development while also thinking about doing accounting. Getting into IT has been nice and learning this has been really fun. I’m also getting certifications for IT so I can get a good job with the experience from school<\/p>\r\n<\/body>\r\n<\/html>\r\n","textColorIndex":0,"bgColorIndex":0}